WEBVTT

00:00:00.008 --> 00:00:04.667
An if statement runs its indented block only when the condition is true.

00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:12.427
Sales is one thousand and the condition asks whether sales is greater than eight hundred.

00:00:12.427 --> 00:00:18.820
Because that is true, Python prints “Good sales day.” Then the program continues and prints “Analysis complete.”

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:21.872
Now imagine sales were seven hundred.

00:00:21.872 --> 00:00:29.752
The indented line would be skipped, but “Analysis complete” would still run because it is outside the if block.

00:00:29.752 --> 00:00:33.282
Indentation is not decoration in Python.

00:00:33.282 --> 00:00:36.351
It defines which lines belong to the decision.
